  data:
    Id: moonveil
    DisplayName: Moonveil
    Description: 'A veil of the same Rift-sliver turns arcane harm aside. Elemental
      family: Arcane, the resistance half -- Astral is Arcane''s separate on-hit
      affix. Split off Astral''s old bundle so a roll grants one or the other, never
      both.'
